```sql
--Description:  Weekly cohort analysis (Mondays) – calculate Week-2 retention for users whose
--              very first `session_start` occurred between 09-Jul-2018 and 17-Sep-2018.
--              Steps
--              1.  “base”  – union all `session_start` events from every Monday table needed
--                  for those cohorts AND from tables exactly two weeks after the last cohort
--                  (01-Oct-2018) so Week-2 look-ups are possible.
--              2.  “cohorts” – the first Monday each user appears (their cohort Monday).
--              3.  “week2”  – same users firing `session_start` exactly two Mondays later.
--              4.  Final SELECT – cohort size, Week-2 returners, and retention rate.
WITH base AS (
